# A73 point 2 (TeraDesk via #Z, sd-tera): open the C: window (double-click
# HARD DISC C (195,35)), select HELLO.TXT (220,340) -> A; hover File (88,8)
# -> B (drop-down open); leave the box downward to empty desktop (88,300):
# the TeraDesk File box spans y 19..245 (H02 run3-B.png), so (88,300) is
# below it, left of the C:\ window (x 165..500) and right of the icon column
# -> C (expected after the fix: box still down, File inverted; before: box
# closed); press/release there -> D (+0.5 s; expected after: box closed,
# HELLO.TXT still selected; before: the click deselected it), E (+3 s).
# Park = bottom-left corner (never crosses the bar). Ticks are 200 Hz.
